  "content": "\n\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/cmRWhN4.png\" alt=\"YUNG's Bridges\" width=\"1344\" height=\"416\" /><br />\n<a title=\"需要 YUNG's API\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/yungs-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungsapibadge\" alt=\"需要 YUNG's API\" width=\"211\" height=\"26\" /></a>&nbsp;<a title=\"加入 YUNG GANG 的 Discord！\" href=\"https://discord.gg/rns3beq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungsdiscordbadge2\" alt=\"加入 YUNG GANG 的 Discord！\" width=\"136\" height=\"28\" /></a>&nbsp;<a title=\"在 Twitter 上關注我！\" href=\"https://twitter.com/yungnickyoung\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungstwitterbadge3\" alt=\"在 Twitter 上關注我！\" width=\"76\" height=\"27\" /></a>&nbsp;<a title=\"訂閱我的 YouTube！\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/yungnickyoung\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungsyoutubebadge\" alt=\"訂閱我的 YouTube！\" width=\"80\" height=\"30\" /></a>&nbsp;<a title=\"在 Patreon 上支持我！\" href=\"https://patreon.com/yungnickyoung\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungspatreonbadge\" alt=\"在 Patreon 上支持我！\" width=\"138\" height=\"28\" /></a><br />\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Ug8dC9A.png\" alt=\"這是什麼？\" width=\"1125\" height=\"59\" /><br />\nYUNG's Bridges 是首款為遊戲添加自然生成橋樑的 Minecraft 模組。探索世界，發現超過 15 種不同類型的橋樑，每種都擁有各生態域專屬的變體！\n</p>\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/4aMS_7aq3ws\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ladFuIF.png\" alt=\"相容性\" width=\"1125\" height=\"59\" /><br />\nYUNG's Bridges 旨在與所有世界生成模組完全相容，包括：\n</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a title=\"YUNG's 更好的沙漠神殿\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/yungs-better-desert-temples\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">YUNG's Better Desert Temples</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"YUNG's 更好的海洋神殿\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/yungs-better-ocean-monuments\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">YUNG's Better Ocean Monuments</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"YUNG's 更好的礦井\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/yungs-better-mineshafts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">YUNG's Better Mineshafts</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"YUNG's 更好的要塞\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/yungs-better-strongholds\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">YUNG's Better Strongholds</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"YUNG's 額外內容\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/yungs-extras\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">YUNG's Extras</a></li>\n<li>Oh the Biomes You'll Go</li>\n<li>Biomes O' Plenty</li>\n<li>Terralith：會使河岸變得更陡峭。橋樑仍可能生成，但會變得稀有。建議嘗試調高生成率。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a title=\"使用 Essential 模組與朋友一起玩！\" href=\"https://essential.gg/x/yung\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2mVOWMC.jpeg\" alt=\"使用 Essential 模組與朋友一起玩！\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/a49IMQJ.png\" /><br />\n<a title=\"在 Bisect Hosting 使用優惠碼 YUNGNICKYOUNG 享受伺服器 25% 折扣！\" href=\"https://bisecthosting.com/yung\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/nQRs7ZP.png\" alt=\"在 Bisect Hosting 使用優惠碼 YUNGNICKYOUNG 享受 25% 折扣！\" width=\"1344\" height=\"400\" /></a></p>",
